  "description": "Romance rekindles amidst urban crisis.\n\n\"Team Zero\"\" is a covert investigation unit unrecorded in any documents. During her pursuit of a monster terrorizing Seoul, Captain Yeo-Heun Jeong encounters her estranged first love, Ji-An Kang. Forced to work together, they uncover unsettling truths about the city's mysteries and their own pasts.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
